 status="new" lang="EN"><p>A novel protein WAR-1 having an activity of inhibiting the proliferation of cancer cells; a DNA encoding the above WAR-1; an expression vector containing this DNA; a transformed cells having this expression vector transferred thereinto; a hybridization probe or a PCR primer DNA comprising the whole DNA encoding WAR-1 or a part thereof; an antibody against the above WAR-1; and utilization of these substances in diagnosis and therapy.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une nouvelle protéine WAR-1 ayant une activité d'inhibition de la prolifération des cellules cancéreuses, un ADN codant la WAR-1 précitée, un vecteur d'expression contenant cet ADN, des cellules transformées dans lesquelles a été transféré ce vecteur d'expression, une sonde d'hybridation ou un ADN à amorce ACP contenant tout l'ADN codant WAR-1 ou une partie de celle-ci, et un anticorps contre la WAR-1 précitée, et l'utilisation de ces substances en diagnostic et en thérapie.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>